%%{init: {'theme':'dark'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLI as run_discover.py
    participant PW as Playwright
    participant CD as CoreDesk
    participant W as web.py
    participant LP as loop.py
    participant PO as policy.py
    participant B as brain.py
    participant G as Gemini API

    CLI->>B: GeminiBrain construct
    CLI->>PW: chromium launch and new_page
    Note over CLI,CD: Sign-in is in the harness. Password never goes to Gemini.
    CLI->>CD: fill user id and password, click Sign On
    CD-->>CLI: session cookie and menu
    CLI->>W: WebSurface construct
    CLI->>LP: DiscoveryLoop run
    LP->>B: configure tools and RULES

    Note over LP,G: Turn N, up to 25 times
    LP->>W: observe
    W->>PW: aria_snapshot per frame
    PW->>CD: GET current page
    CD-->>PW: HTML
    W->>W: parse tree, assign refs, strip passwords
    W-->>LP: Observation
    LP->>LP: build compacted history plus current obs
    LP->>B: decide
    B->>G: generate_content mode ANY, AFC off
    G-->>B: function_call click ref e39
    B-->>LP: BrainResponse
    LP->>LP: build_action, validate into_output and from_input

    alt name not in declared inputs or outputs
        LP->>LP: write StepRecord invalid_action
        LP-->>LP: next turn, feedback to the model
        Note over LP: The enum advises — this check is what binds.
    else names are declared
        LP->>LP: find Node by ref in this observation only
        LP->>PO: policy_check mode DISCOVERY
        PO-->>LP: Verdict

        alt policy blocked
            LP->>LP: write StepRecord policy_blocked
            LP-->>LP: next turn
        else done or escalate or give_up or stuck
            LP->>W: act Done
            LP-->>CLI: DiscoveryResult
            Note over LP,CLI: stuck ends the CLI run. The console instead<br/>pauses and hands the browser to a human.
        else click or type or read
            LP->>W: act
            W->>PW: get_by_role click or fill
            PW->>CD: click or POST
            CD-->>PW: next page
            W-->>LP: ActionResult and ResolutionTrace
            LP->>W: observe again
            LP->>LP: write transcript.jsonl
        end
    end
